{"concept":"memory","groups":[{"id":"forgetting","name":{"ru":"Забвение","en":"Forgetting"},"count":25},{"id":"remembering","name":{"ru":"Воспоминание и память","en":"Recollection and memory"},"count":17}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3e0132aacc561efc3d23dc3a50131d2f","tos.text-unit.sid-3e0132aacc561efc3d23dc3a50131d2f"]},"form":"vergisst","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["becoming","identity","going-under","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Переполненная душа забывает себя и вмещает вещи.","en":"The overflowing soul forgets itself and contains things."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d9ab06239136a27837820f35e7781de9","tos.text-unit.sid-d9ab06239136a27837820f35e7781de9"]},"form":"vergass","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["becoming","body-self","earth","loneliness"],"line":{"ru":"Умерший удерживает Заратустру в задумчивости до забвения времени.","en":"The dead man holds Zarathustra in thought until time is forgotten."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e90988be74cd745975760870597e9ae9","tos.text-unit.sid-b812ddfa7b222c7d053ee976f037cd1d"]},"form":"vergass","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"hermit-host","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Забвение еды приводит Заратустру к гостеприимству старика.","en":"Forgetting food brings Zarathustra to the old man’s hospitality."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646","tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646"]},"form":"Vergessen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["child","affirmation","wheel","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дитя начинает игру невинностью, забвением и священным да.","en":"The child begins play through innocence, forgetting and a sacred yes."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b6805ef35b4df1ae5e7e2e250410eaf0","tos.text-unit.sid-b6805ef35b4df1ae5e7e2e250410eaf0"]},"form":"vergessen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["will","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лихорадочный труд раскрывается бегством от себя.","en":"Feverish work unfolds as flight from oneself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-efa79f9a19530f2cecb07c5c91dff0df","tos.text-unit.sid-efa79f9a19530f2cecb07c5c91dff0df"]},"form":"vergessen","speaker":"old-woman","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"quoted","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["identity","old-woman"],"line":{"ru":"Старушка просит речь о женщине, обещая забыть её.","en":"The old woman asks a speech about woman, promising to forget it."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a25e771bc5d9c7c9154e38926f67408a","tos.text-unit.sid-a25e771bc5d9c7c9154e38926f67408a"]},"form":"Vergiss","speaker":"old-woman","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"quoted","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["old-woman"],"line":{"ru":"Старушка завершает разговор своей фразой о плети.","en":"The old woman closes the conversation with her saying about the whip."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-96f0649578b9adcd7b17daaf08c5bc47","tos.text-unit.sid-96f0649578b9adcd7b17daaf08c5bc47"]},"form":"vergessen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["agency","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Память одиночки делает причинённую ему несправедливость тяжёлой.","en":"The solitary person’s memory makes wronging them weighty."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6d5d64df7654526f06be7538126618e8","tos.text-unit.sid-6d5d64df7654526f06be7538126618e8"]},"form":"vergessen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Память малой услуги способна превратиться в грызущую обиду.","en":"Remembering a small favour can become a gnawing resentment."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-052288a28ed591a5da15fd83898f4c85","tos.text-unit.sid-052288a28ed591a5da15fd83898f4c85"]},"form":"vergessen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["agency","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Забытое дело продолжает действовать своим светом.","en":"The forgotten deed continues to act through its light."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-500267120ace5cd44cbdd1340664c752","tos.text-unit.sid-500267120ace5cd44cbdd1340664c752"]},"form":"vergesst","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Имена добрых и справедливых испытываются скрытой жаждой власти.","en":"The names good and just are tested through a hidden desire for power."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-777a2b12a098997e217b85dc8e912e25","tos.text-unit.sid-777a2b12a098997e217b85dc8e912e25"]},"form":"erinnert","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"life","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"remembering","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Мудрость напоминает Заратустре Жизнь.","en":"Wisdom reminds Zarathustra of Life."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-933bbeaeee0cbb8c339a199aa6804729","tos.text-unit.sid-933bbeaeee0cbb8c339a199aa6804729"]},"form":"gedenke","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"remembering","neighbours":["present","gateway","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель оплакивает божественные мгновения юности.","en":"The teacher mourns youth’s divine moments."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-af31cd4d8d4e5ef1dfe6df6dfa87d66e","tos.text-unit.sid-af31cd4d8d4e5ef1dfe6df6dfa87d66e"]},"form":"Gedächtnisse","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"remembering","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Память погибшей любви цветёт дикими добродетелями.","en":"Memory of lost love flowers in wild virtues."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6620ecc9c0cb18945a6f5eef217c561b","tos.text-unit.sid-6620ecc9c0cb18945a6f5eef217c561b"]},"form":"Gedächtnisse","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"remembering","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Памяти погибших надежд посвящены венок и проклятие.","en":"A wreath and curse are dedicated to lost hopes’ memory."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-efb0ec8c759eb6bb5552aa6dac24dc1a","tos.text-unit.sid-efb0ec8c759eb6bb5552aa6dac24dc1a"]},"form":"Gedächtniss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"remembering","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Хранение всех оснований сравнивается с бочкой памяти.","en":"Keeping all one’s reasons is compared to a barrel of memory."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8572e381aecd13c17dd12a0f2ce150d6","tos.text-unit.sid-8572e381aecd13c17dd12a0f2ce150d6"]},"form":"gedenke","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"remembering","neighbours":["will","identity","difference","agency","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Узнавание учеников возвращает учителя от тяжёлого сна к трапезе.","en":"Recognizing the disciples returns the teacher from a heavy dream to a meal."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-488f52a437b5e1552171d69000a63528","tos.text-unit.sid-488f52a437b5e1552171d69000a63528"]},"form":"Erinnerungen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sea","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"remembering","neighbours":["attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Стон моря вызывает вопрос о тяжёлой памяти и ожидании.","en":"The sea’s moan raises the question of painful memory and expectation."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0a4892ccc3fc95b079e334ce01fdbffb","tos.text-unit.sid-b4b5f1833f2583fc880beede7d0cf125"]},"form":"vergass","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["identity","difference","zarathustra","god"],"line":{"ru":"Ревнивый Бог забывается притязанием на единственность.","en":"The jealous god forgets himself in claiming uniqueness."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0be54bfd8103885bda28a88a2e127bac","tos.text-unit.sid-0be54bfd8103885bda28a88a2e127bac"]},"form":"Vergessen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"loneliness","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Среди людей забвение и прохождение мимо становятся мудростью.","en":"Among people forgetting and passing by become wisdom."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bbaa73dec6b38f01904e6dc20dc3c799","tos.text-unit.sid-bbaa73dec6b38f01904e6dc20dc3c799"]},"form":"Gedenken","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"remembering","neighbours":["attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ограниченная память рода останавливает время на деде.","en":"Limited ancestral memory stops time at the grandfather."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-97bb32220c792be707aeb3429b0801d4","tos.text-unit.sid-97bb32220c792be707aeb3429b0801d4"]},"form":"unvergessner","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["joy-lust","earth","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Память земной радости выдаёт скрытое желание жизни.","en":"Remembered earthly joy betrays a hidden desire for life."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f2b187a52ad03363125158d78efd1c9b","tos.text-unit.sid-f2b187a52ad03363125158d78efd1c9b"]},"form":"vergessen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Забвение внутреннего обольщает звуками.","en":"Forgetting inwardness enchants through sounds."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9f1471144e729291311298ed75a2a53b","tos.text-unit.sid-1fdb6b338b3ca379b3fc0d4b9a295d84"]},"form":"erinnerte","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"remembering","neighbours":["identity","nausea","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Память болезни вновь отзывается криком отвращения.","en":"The illness’s memory answers again with disgust’s cry."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-74ea87fb8c7726f974112eb45a0f890a","tos.text-unit.sid-74ea87fb8c7726f974112eb45a0f890a"]},"form":"vergass","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"life","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["dance","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель требует танца под ритм своей плети.","en":"The teacher demands dancing to his whip’s rhythm."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4d152f0293a13910b0d1b8c7281c3050","tos.text-unit.sid-4d152f0293a13910b0d1b8c7281c3050"]},"form":"vergass","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["fate","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Неторопливая судьба получает образ забывшего о путнике ловца мух.","en":"Unhurried fate is pictured as a fly-catcher forgetting the traveller."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b186e72c7c68ad05cfe7afdaffa094e6","tos.text-unit.sid-b186e72c7c68ad05cfe7afdaffa094e6"]},"form":"vergessenen","speaker":"soothsayer","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["soothsayer"],"line":{"ru":"Прорицатель ищет счастье на далёких забытых морях.","en":"The soothsayer seeks happiness on distant forgotten seas."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b7bae5042bea766dc23de866b5c9c3c4","tos.text-unit.sid-b7bae5042bea766dc23de866b5c9c3c4"]},"form":"Erinnerungen","speaker":"last-pope","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"remembering","neighbours":["joy-lust","last-pope"],"line":{"ru":"Папа без господина сохраняет радость в воспоминаниях.","en":"The masterless pope retains joy in memories."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ed11fdcafb225e596c07396d158731e4","tos.text-unit.sid-ed11fdcafb225e596c07396d158731e4"]},"form":"Erinnerungen","speaker":"last-pope","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"remembering","neighbours":["last-pope"],"line":{"ru":"Память богослужения становится надеждой нового праздника.","en":"Memory of worship becomes hope for a new festival."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-20887564ca9a135a4044bdbde15799a3","tos.text-unit.sid-20887564ca9a135a4044bdbde15799a3"]},"form":"Erinnerung","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"remembering","neighbours":["becoming"],"line":{"ru":"Чёрное воспоминание останавливает шаг перед безобразным.","en":"A black recollection halts the step before the ugly one."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-aab2186841ffa6dc14a9ffbaaf7b2307","tos.text-unit.sid-aab2186841ffa6dc14a9ffbaaf7b2307"]},"form":"vergesslich","speaker":"beggar","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["will","beggar"],"line":{"ru":"Нищий описывает богатую чернь через её происхождение и привычки.","en":"The beggar describes the wealthy rabble through ancestry and habits."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-251d3e1e961e759e21579013f7080236","tos.text-unit.sid-251d3e1e961e759e21579013f7080236"]},"form":"vergessen","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["fate","becoming","necessity","agency"],"line":{"ru":"Сон забывает малую жажду, сохраняя открытый взгляд.","en":"Sleep forgets the little thirst while keeping the gaze open."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-afd334c01d55446c218423bf7a326888","tos.text-unit.sid-afd334c01d55446c218423bf7a326888"]},"form":"Erinnerung","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"remembering","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Память гостей изображена скрытой ношей и карликом.","en":"The guests’ memory is pictured as a hidden burden and dwarf."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-af6f3d62898e311038d465ad67e1f802","tos.text-unit.sid-af6f3d62898e311038d465ad67e1f802"]},"form":"vergesst","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["dance","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Поднятые сердца должны вспомнить танцующие ноги.","en":"Raised hearts are to remember dancing feet."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-14ab65c90417c9aef524b3987b2db74c","tos.text-unit.sid-14ab65c90417c9aef524b3987b2db74c"]},"form":"vergesst","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["dance","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Призыв поднять сердца повторён вместе с призывом поднять ноги.","en":"The call to raise hearts is repeated with the call to raise feet."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fa16e1802680816c74c483dc3db5a534","tos.text-unit.sid-fa16e1802680816c74c483dc3db5a534"]},"form":"vergesst","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["laughter","dance","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель соединяет поднятые сердца, ноги и смех.","en":"The teacher joins raised hearts, feet and laughter."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-eb0c773a9f15394bb19d5e177c244834","tos.text-unit.sid-eb0c773a9f15394bb19d5e177c244834"]},"form":"gedenkst","speaker":"magician","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"remembering","neighbours":["courage","will","becoming","identity","attention","laughter","ring","body-self","rope-bridge","earth","magician"],"line":{"ru":"Песнь чародея вспоминает жажду истины через образы хищной поэзии.","en":"The magician’s song recalls thirst for truth through predatory images of poetry."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4305bd2014bdb25ae6f537128a5f2f98","tos.text-unit.sid-4305bd2014bdb25ae6f537128a5f2f98"]},"form":"Erinnerung","speaker":"shadow","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"remembering","neighbours":["shadow"],"line":{"ru":"Тень просит принять старую память в форме песни.","en":"The shadow asks that an old memory be received as song."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-560c8e1bc5e590cf6443e36f4cc8d830","tos.text-unit.sid-560c8e1bc5e590cf6443e36f4cc8d830"]},"form":"Erinnerungen","speaker":"shadow","addressee":"daughters","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["courage","will","lion","affirmation","identity","difference","agency","bite","dance","loneliness","shadow"],"line":{"ru":"Тень разыгрывает европейскую добродетель пародией нравственного льва.","en":"The shadow performs European virtue as a parody of the moral lion."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7a59b5517f7f188261ad3c4711f88232","tos.text-unit.sid-7a59b5517f7f188261ad3c4711f88232"]},"form":"Vergesst","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"forgetting","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ослиный праздник поручено хранить знаком выздоровления.","en":"The ass festival is to be remembered as a sign of recovery."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-aa5bef7c21a89f5118d279c3a48dc5fb","tos.text-unit.sid-aa5bef7c21a89f5118d279c3a48dc5fb"]},"form":"Gedächtniss","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"remembering","neighbours":["agency","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Повтор праздника предложен в память учителя.","en":"Repeating the festival is proposed in the teacher’s memory."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c0e3a3517b021107cee042466f68a20d","tos.text-unit.sid-c0e3a3517b021107cee042466f68a20d"]},"form":"Erinnerung","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"remembering","neighbours":["affirmation","necessity","attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воспоминание собирает вчера и сегодня одним взглядом.","en":"Recollection gathers yesterday and today in one glance."}}]}
